#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

// #taxon[Taxon]
#title[Identity type of Dirichlet Product]

Let $(T,U,e,a,b)$ and $(T',U',e',a',b')$ be terms in the dirichlet product $(F *_D G)(S)$ of #link("00DT")[species] $F$ and $G$.

Let $A(T,U,e) :-= F(T) xx G(U)$ be indexed by the type of #local("00DQ")[cartesian decompositions], then
$
  &((T,U,e,a,b) =_(F *_D G) (T',U',e',a',b'))\
  &~= sum (p : (T,U,e) =_"cart-dec"(S) (T',U',e')),"tr"_A (p,(a,b))=(a',b')\
  &~= sum ((r,s,f): sum (p: A = A', q : B = B'), e' @ (p xx q) =_(A xx B ~= S) e), ("tr"_A (h(r,s,f), (a,b)) = (a',b'))\
  &~= sum ((r,s,f): sum (p: A = A', q : B = B'), e' @ (p xx q) =_(A xx B ~= S) e), (("tr"_F (r,a) = a') xx ("tr"_G (s,b) = b'))\
$



where $h$ is the equivalence characterizing the #local("00DY")[identity type of cart-dec].

In the second step we are using that, given some equivalence of types $p: A = A'$, we get an equivalence

$
  sum (a: A), B(a) ~= sum (a : A'), B(p^(-1)( a)) .. "TODO: Details"
$


In the third step we are using the follwing.
Given any $p:(T,U,e) =_"cart-dec"(S) (T',U',e')$, we have
$
  ("tr"_A (h(p),(a,b))=(a',b')) ~= (("tr"_F (p, a) = a') xx ("tr"_F (q, b) = b'))
$
